message: "If you use this project, please cite it as below. For the planetary data itself, please cite the DE440 paper."
title: "Solar System Classroom"
abstract: >-
  A page for teachers and students that shows where the Sun and planets really are, at true scale, calculated from
  NASA JPL's DE440 ephemeris and checked against JPL Horizons.
type: software
authors:
